model wc
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-15
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-03-31
  note "T, M3 C6, gate 8's walk/plan.rs class_depends and walk/ends.rs window_hole_ends (E §4.1 steps 2-3, L §4.4; tally 2.1.8 item 77): a plan dated by a window that starts on the run's first day (no day before the start: its class doesn't depend on it), one dated by a window every day of which a statement covers (modelled past, not a hole), and one into a place whose life starts inside its window (its lifespan test both ways: the window's hole at both ends)"

source fixture "T's fixture (invented values)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place konto2: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place newacc: accounts PLN lives 2026-02-05..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input bank: observed

input first_day: date

input covered_day: date

input new_day: date

input amt: money PLN

move first_gift: transfers
  on first_day
  leg cash from world to konto2 amount amt

move covered_pay: transfers
  on covered_day
  leg cash from konto to world amount amt

move new_gift: transfers
  on new_day
  leg cash from world to newacc amount amt

version facts
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  first_day = window(2026-01-01, 2026-01-10) "some day in the run's first ten days"
  covered_day = window(2026-02-03, 2026-02-08) "some day in early February"
  new_day = window(2026-02-01, 2026-02-10) "some day early in February"
  amt = 50.00 PLN "the amount"
  opening[konto] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[konto2] = 100.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start

version bank_feb
  cite fixture
  governs 2026-02
  known 2026-03-02
  covers konto
  anchor konto
  bank[b20260205] = (on: 2026-02-05, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to world amount 55.00 PLN, fulfils: covered_pay) "the payment, five more"
  stated[konto] = 945.00 PLN at 2026-02-28 end "the month's closing balance"

ask q_first: bal(konto2, d) for d in [2026-01-05, 2026-01-10, 2026-01-31] law cut

ask q_covered: bal(konto, d) for d in [2026-02-04, 2026-02-28] law cut

ask q_new: bal(newacc, d) for d in [2026-02-07, 2026-02-10, 2026-02-28] law cut

ask q_res: residuals konto 2026-02 law cut

ask x_first: explain first_gift

ask x_covered: explain covered_pay

ask x_new: explain new_gift
